+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5135+) **Preferential master–vassal tech trading:** Heavily increase willingness to trade techs with our **master/vassal(s)**; change in `CvPlayerAI::AI_doDiplo`. This synergises with the earlier “devalue techs your master/vassal already knows” change (see [Technologies (AI)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md#technologies-ai)) and extends it **to *all* techs**, not just ones that overlap with what our master/vassal(s) already knows. In one autoplay sample this led to noticeably **less overlap** and better sharing (e.g. a master gaining ~4 more and 1 fewer tech, a vassal ~2 more and 0 fewer over T250–300 compared to before). Also fixed a missing second parameter in `AI_contactRoll(CONTACT_TRADE_TECH` (according to ChatGPT 5.1), which may have contributed to earlier skew. Details: [KI#78](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#78---tremendously-improved-trade-techs-preferentially-with-our-vassals-or-master-synergises-with-the-no-overlap-previous-master-vassals-tweak--bugfix-missing-second-parameter-now-ai_contactrollcontact_trade_tech-rcontactprobmult-according-to-chatgpt-51).
 
